Conducts: illiterate, genoless, polyselfless, artiwishless

This was my first samurai ascension, as well as my first illiterate
and first genoless conduct ascension. I haven't played lawful or
combat-focused characters before this, so lots of new experiences.
I want to thank David Damerell for his Object Identification Spoiler,
which I consult regularly in every game, but never as much as I did
for illiterate! The whole combination was quite fun to play. I got a
ridiculous number of wishes given that I couldn't recharge any /oW.

In all of my past ascensions I have read b?oGeno on Water for ; and
again on Astral for L, so I was a little apprehensive, but it turned
out they weren't as bad as I expected. I confess I got very lucky
with finding portals on the planes (given no ?oGD), though I did have
to visit all three altars to win.

