LESSONS LEARNED

wear =oFA, if possible, before moving to mind flayer line-of-sight
  ...in case he has !oPara
when doing sacfest, check hunger (and eat) before #pray
  ...otherwise god may fix your hunger, and not give gifts
when playing illiterate, save and bring all ?oCrMon to sacfest
  ...leave them on the ground; monsters might read them for you? :-)
